sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant QC as QuestionClassifier (Type)
    participant QIC as QueryIntentClassifier (Retrieval Intent)

    Browser->>API: question text

    Note over API,QC: Phase 1 — Question type (rule-based regex, zero LLM cost)
    API->>QC: classify(question)
    Note over QC: First match wins:<br/>INVALID → OUT_OF_SCOPE → STRATEGIC → CONTACT_REDIRECT →<br/>PERSONAL → FACTUAL → BEHAVIORAL_PRE → TECHNICAL → BEHAVIORAL (default)

    alt Gate types — INVALID / OUT_OF_SCOPE / STRATEGIC / CONTACT_REDIRECT / PERSONAL
        QC-->>API: earlyReturn message (no RAG cost)
        API-->>Browser: message + done
    else Answerable — FACTUAL / BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL
        QC-->>API: QuestionType (drives prompt mode + retrieval strategy)
    end

    Note over API,QIC: Phase 2 — Retrieval intent tags (BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL / STRATEGIC only)
    API->>QIC: classify(question)
    alt Keyword rules matched (8 intent groups)
        QIC-->>API: 1-3 intent_tags
    else No keyword match
        QIC->>QIC: LLM fallback via Claude (returns [] on failure)
        QIC-->>API: 1-3 intent_tags (or [])
    end
    Note right of QIC: Intents: architecture, production_issue, leadership, delivery,<br/>technical_depth, ambiguity, conflict, growth

    API->>API: Continue to strategy selection → retrieval
